  "description": "CIDGAZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H66 Cu7 Dy2 N8 O38 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),8.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu3 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu4 (Cu) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Cu5 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu6 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu7 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.175-3.915 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.84-115.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy₂Cu₇(OH)₂(L²)₂(L³)₂(OAc)₈(NO₃)₂(H₂O)₄](NO₃)₂·8.5H₂O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
